85: /// The game's own frame counter (D297 (b)): incremented by the game every
86: /// frame.  Every value a semantic tool returns carries this number as its
87: /// `frame`, so a claim about "the game advanced" is a claim about the game, not
88: /// about how often the adapter polled.
89: #[derive(Resource, Reflect, Debug, Clone, Copy, Default)]
90: #[reflect(Resource)]
91: pub struct FrameCounter {
