95: /// The injection surface (PRD §3-C3).  It is a **level-triggered** resource:
96: /// `move_dir` stays where it was written until it is overwritten, while the
97: /// jump's edge is consumed by the game itself (`game::apply_input` latches
98: /// `jump_pressed`), so holding a direction really moves the player instead of
99: /// moving for a single frame.
100: #[derive(Resource, Reflect, Debug, Clone, Copy, Default)]
101: #[reflect(Resource)]
